{
  "key": 41377,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_CyrusStayClose",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Stay close. This world does\n",
        "not keep to our rules.\r",
        "Up, down... Even the ground under\n",
        "your feet is just a suggestion."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_BarryIllJustJumpIt",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: There! The briefcase\n",
        "is on that platform down there!\r",
        "Pfft, that's not even far.\n",
        "I'll just jump it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_BarryIMeantToDoThat",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Whoa! ...Huh?\n",
        "How'd I end up back up here?\r",
        "I-I totally meant to do that!\n",
        "I was testing it for you, OK?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_CyrusTheVoidSendsItBack",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: The void does not keep what\n",
        "falls into it. It sends it back.\r",
        "I will experiment. Let us see if\n",
        "we can jump straight there.\r",
        "Why don't you try to find\n",
        "another path?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_CyrusBackWhereWeStarted",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...Back where we started.\n",
        "This world will not let go of us\f",
        "so easily."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_CyrusWalkTheSeam",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Look at the cliff face.\n",
        "Those cracks are seams.\r",
        "Where this world was stitched\n",
        "together, you can walk.\r",
        "Step onto the wall.\n",
        "Walk the seam."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_CyrusTheSeamSplits",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: The seam splits!\n",
        "Mind where each path leads."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_SomethingMovedBelow",
      "en_US": [
        "...!\n",
        "Something moved down there."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_CyrusThereRowansCase",
      "en_US": "Cyrus: There. Rowan's case."
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_BarryPickOne",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: We found it!\n",
        "Now Rowan owes us one!\r",
        "Go on, pick one first!\n",
        "I'll take whatever beats yours!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_BarryIllTakeThisOne",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Then I'll take this\n",
        "one! Let's go, {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_MawileDroppedSomething",
      "en_US": [
        "The Mawile dropped something\n",
        "and fled into the dark!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_CyrusHarvesting",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: A shard... Cracked, and\n",
        "still humming with power.\r",
        "That Pok\u00e9mon was not wild with\n",
        "fear. It was wild with pain.\r",
        "Someone has been... harvesting."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_CyrusTheWorldIsClosing",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: The world is closing.\n",
        "This way."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_CyrusWatchAndListen",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: This world shows its paths\n",
        "to those who look for them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_CyrusTheWallWillHoldYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Walk the seam.\n",
        "The wall will hold you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_BarryHurryUp",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What are you\n",
        "waiting for? Hurry up!\r",
        "If I get there first,\n",
        "I'm fining you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_CyrusStayNearMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Stay near me.\n",
        "The rift will not stay open long."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_CyrusTheWorldFolds",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: This world folds.\n",
        "Step where I step."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_BarryHeyWaitUp",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey! Don't you\n",
        "dare leave me behind!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldArc1Seams_Text_BarryHowDidWeDoThat",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Whoa... Did we just\n",
        "walk through thin air?!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
